<title>NETHERLANDS: Emba mulls sale of French bank stake.</title>
<headline>Emba mulls sale of French bank stake.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch banking, real estate and venture capital group Emba said on Wednesday it was in talks to sell its stake in French bank Messieurs Hottinguer &amp; Cie.</p>
<p>Emba said it was in talks with a number of international banking consortia to sell the majority stake but gave no details.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
